## Why This Is Asked

Tests candidate ability to design a mixed on-device/offload chat triage, evaluating lifecycle costs and business impact of privacy-preserving UX.

## Key Concepts

- On-device NLP model size and latency
- Cloud handoff economics
- Local storage and OTA updates
- Compliance and user trust
- Rollout and measurement plan

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code for on-device classifier trigger
function triage(input) {
  const intent = onDeviceModel.predict(input);
  if (isComplex(intent)) {
    return cloudHandoff(input);
  }
  return generateResponse(intent);
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you measure incremental savings from reduced cloud fetches?
- What telemetry would you collect to monitor quality without compromising privacy?

## Why This Is Asked

Explore data-locality, privacy, and practical CBA modeling for a lightweight client-side feature in a cloud data platform.

## Key Concepts

- Data locality and offline caching
- Cost modeling: storage, compute, network
- Privacy/compliance: anonymization, retention, audits
- Rollout strategy and go/no-go criteria

## Code Example

```javascript
function estimateCBA(params) {
  // simple cost model placeholder
  const { storagePerUserMB, months, users } = params;
  const storageCostPerMB = 0.02; // hypothetical
  const totalStorage = storagePerUserMB * users * months;
  return totalStorage * storageCostPerMB;
}
```

